+| L2 | centered+L2 | 9.60% | 10.08% | 8.87% | 18.70% | 26.24% | 0.0216 | 4.7958 |
+| L2 | centered+PCA-white | 26.11% | 20.29% | **17.21%** | **22.73%** | 30.97% | -0.0051 | 21.6066 |
